Soratra rehefa: ['html'] ataovy: { <- (
		tena
		soloy: ['&'] amin: ['&amp;'],
		soloy: ['<'] amin: ['&lt;'],
		soloy: ['>'] amin: ['&gt;'],
		soloy: ['"'] amin: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lisitra vaovao.

['Verbatim Syntax'] litera-rehetra tsirairay: { :isa :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (isa), Letter: letter).
}.

Vokatra list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list atambaro: ['↵']).

Vokatra soraty: template.

